      "updated": 1,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Sustituyen a docker-compose.yml.\nVersionables en Git y reproducibles en\ncualquier clúster (dev, staging, prod)\nsolo cambiando ConfigMap/Secret.\n\nOperar:  kubectl get / describe / logs /\nscale / rollout status / rollout undo",
      "originalText": "Sustituyen a docker-compose.yml.\nVersionables en Git y reproducibles en\ncualquier clúster (dev, staging, prod)\nsolo cambiando ConfigMap/Secret.\n\nOperar:  kubectl get / describe / logs /\nscale / rollout status / rollout undo",
      "fontSize": 11,
      "fontFamily": 3,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
