      "updated": 1,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "ConfigMap (no sensible):\n   DB_URL, SERVER_PORT, JWT_EXPIRATION\nSecret (base64, credenciales):\n   DB_USER, DB_PASSWORD, JWT_SECRET\nSe inyectan con envFrom → variables de\nentorno del contenedor. Sustituyen al\nbloque `environment:` de Compose.",
      "originalText": "ConfigMap (no sensible):\n   DB_URL, SERVER_PORT, JWT_EXPIRATION\nSecret (base64, credenciales):\n   DB_USER, DB_PASSWORD, JWT_SECRET\nSe inyectan con envFrom → variables de\nentorno del contenedor. Sustituyen al\nbloque `environment:` de Compose.",
